@@ -0,0 +1,14 @@
+## Context
+
+Existing modules (`json-pointer.ts`, `json-patch.ts`) are dependency-free and return new values.
+
+## Decisions
+
+- Implement the RFC pseudo-code recursively in `src/json-merge-patch.ts`, building a fresh result instead of mutating.
+- Plain objects are non-null, non-array objects. Members are copied with `Object.defineProperty` so a `__proto__` key becomes an own property rather than changing the prototype.
+- Non-object patches (and nested non-object values) are deep-copied.
+- No error type: the algorithm is total over JSON values.
+
+## Risks
+
+Output key order follows target keys first, then new patch keys; JSON semantics make this irrelevant.
