+## Why
+
+Some clients send partial updates as JSON Merge Patch (RFC 7386) rather than JSON Patch. The library needs to apply them.
+
+## What Changes
+
+- Add `applyMergePatch(target, patch)`, exported from `src/index.ts`, implementing RFC 7386.
+- Document it in the README.
+
+## Capabilities
+
+### New Capabilities
+- `json-merge-patch`: applying RFC 7386 JSON Merge Patch documents.
+
+### Modified Capabilities
+
+## Impact
+
+New file `src/json-merge-patch.ts` with tests, an export in `src/index.ts`, and a README section. No new dependencies.
